 "kind": "statement",
 "title": "Finite flat modules over finite type algebras over valuation rings are finitely presented",
 "statement": "Let $A$ be a valuation ring. Let $A\\to B$ be a ring map of finite type [def-weil-pbc-finite-type-algebra]. Let $M$ be a finite $B$-module [def-weil-finitely-generated-module]. If $M$ is flat as an $A$-module [def-weil-pbc-flat-ring-map], then $M$ is finitely presented as a $B$-module [def-sc-finitely-presented-module].",
